        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "1. The words “reserve components of \nthe armed services” are substituted for \nthe words “National Guard” occurring in \nthe title and preamble of the said order."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1845,
      "char_start": 1780,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10059#2",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10059#2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "14 FR 2845, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2adeb3995eb0f637d7b778034614f62d157e38455104f17ed5cf6cea8c5747c1",
        "signing_date": "1949-05-27",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10059.txt",
        "text_sha256": "b4e64330c272e897f26c5a837e739e28dd5da70a15072238e809af9d554e7f5b",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "2. Paragraph 11 of the said order is \namended to read as follows:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2241,
      "char_start": 1846,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10059#11",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "11.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10059#11",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "14 FR 2845, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2adeb3995eb0f637d7b778034614f62d157e38455104f17ed5cf6cea8c5747c1",
        "signing_date": "1949-05-27",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10059.txt",
        "text_sha256": "b4e64330c272e897f26c5a837e739e28dd5da70a15072238e809af9d554e7f5b",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "11. For each officer, warrant officer, or \nenlisted person of the reserve compo­\nnents of the armed services not in the \nactive military service of the United \nStates who is in an inactive-duty-train­\ning pay status or drill pay status and \nwho is required to participate regularly \nand frequently in aerial flights by orders \nof competent authority, the following re­\nquirements are prescribed:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2418,
      "char_start": 2242,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10059#a",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(a)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10059#a",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "14 FR 2845, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2adeb3995eb0f637d7b778034614f62d157e38455104f17ed5cf6cea8c5747c1",
        "signing_date": "1949-05-27",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10059.txt",
        "text_sha256": "b4e64330c272e897f26c5a837e739e28dd5da70a15072238e809af9d554e7f5b",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(a) During one calendar month: 4 or \nmore flights totaling at least 72 minutes \n(1.2 hours), or in lieu thereof to be in \nthe air a total of at least 96 minutes \n(1.6 hours). ."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2697,
      "char_start": 2419,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10059#b",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(b)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10059#b",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "14 FR 2845, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2adeb3995eb0f637d7b778034614f62d157e38455104f17ed5cf6cea8c5747c1",
        "signing_date": "1949-05-27",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10059.txt",
        "text_sha256": "b4e64330c272e897f26c5a837e739e28dd5da70a15072238e809af9d554e7f5b",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(b) During two consecutive calendar \nmonths when the requirements of sub- \nparagraph (a) above have not been met: \n8 or more flights totaling at least 144 \nminuted (2.4 hours), or in lieu thereof \nto be in the air a total of at least 192 \nminutes (3.2 hours).\n13 CFR, Cum. Supp."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2960,
      "char_start": 2698,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10059#c",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(c)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10059#c",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "14 FR 2845, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2adeb3995eb0f637d7b778034614f62d157e38455104f17ed5cf6cea8c5747c1",
        "signing_date": "1949-05-27",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10059.txt",
        "text_sha256": "b4e64330c272e897f26c5a837e739e28dd5da70a15072238e809af9d554e7f5b",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(c) During three consecutive calendar \nmonths when the requirements of sub- \n.paragraph (b) above have not been met:\n12 or more flights totaling at least 216 \nminutes (3.6 hours), or in lieu thereof \nto be in the air a total of at least 288 \nminutes (4.8 hours)."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3286,
      "char_start": 2961,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10059#d",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(d)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10059#d",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "14 FR 2845, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2adeb3995eb0f637d7b778034614f62d157e38455104f17ed5cf6cea8c5747c1",
        "signing_date": "1949-05-27",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10059.txt",
        "text_sha256": "b4e64330c272e897f26c5a837e739e28dd5da70a15072238e809af9d554e7f5b",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(d) Such required flights may be made \nat ordered drills, or equivalent periods of \ntraining, Instruction, or duty, of the or­\nganization to which such officer, warrant \nofficer, or enlisted person belongs or is \nattached, or at other times in accordance \nwith regulations prescribed by the head \nof the department concerned."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3557,
      "char_start": 3287,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10059#e",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(e)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10059#e",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "14 FR 2845, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2adeb3995eb0f637d7b778034614f62d157e38455104f17ed5cf6cea8c5747c1",
        "signing_date": "1949-05-27",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10059.txt",
        "text_sha256": "b4e64330c272e897f26c5a837e739e28dd5da70a15072238e809af9d554e7f5b",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(e) For fractions of a calendar month, \nthe number of aerial flights and the time \nin the air required shall bear the same \nratio to the number of flights and the \ntime in the air required for a full cal­\nendar month as the period in question \nbears to the entire month."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3720,
      "char_start": 3558,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10059#f",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(f)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10059#f",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "14 FR 2845, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2adeb3995eb0f637d7b778034614f62d157e38455104f17ed5cf6cea8c5747c1",
        "signing_date": "1949-05-27",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10059.txt",
        "text_sha256": "b4e64330c272e897f26c5a837e739e28dd5da70a15072238e809af9d554e7f5b",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(f) The duties prescribed above shall \nbe in addition to any other duty or duties \nwhich may be required of such officers, \nwarrant officers, or enlisted persons."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3975,
      "char_start": 3721,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:10059#f-3",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:10059#f-3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "14 FR 2845, PDF pages 1-1",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "2adeb3995eb0f637d7b778034614f62d157e38455104f17ed5cf6cea8c5747c1",
        "signing_date": "1949-05-27",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_10059.txt",
        "text_sha256": "b4e64330c272e897f26c5a837e739e28dd5da70a15072238e809af9d554e7f5b",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1949-06-01/pdf/FR-1949-06-01.pdf"
      },
      "text": "3. This order shall become effective on \nJune 1, 1949, except that as to personnel \nentitled to increased pay for performing \naerial flights under section 313 of the \nNaval Reserve Act of 1938 it shall become \neffective on July 1, 1949.\nH arry 8. T ruman"
    }
  ],
